node_modules
dist
.git
.github
*.md
!docs/smokecraft/*.md
# docs/ is ~72MB, dominated by three large internal-only trees below (a
# real, previously-found root cause: scripts/validateSmokecraftPlayerStateIntegrity.mjs
# reads docs/smokecraft/SMOKECRAFT_STATE_OWNERSHIP_MAP.md as a build-blocking
# check, and a blanket `docs` exclusion here made that file always ENOENT in
# every Docker build, regardless of source-code correctness). Exclude the
# three large, build-irrelevant subtrees explicitly instead of the whole
# directory, so real, small, build-necessary documentation under docs/
# (docs/smokecraft/ in particular) stays available in the build context —
# a blanket parent-directory exclude can never be selectively re-included
# by a later negation, so this must be scoped at the subdirectory level.
docs/ui-ux-handoff
docs/visual-proof
docs/audits
proof
public/proof
public/handoff
recovery-archives
attached_assets
stitch_export
visual-regression-baselines
visual-regression-current
visual-regression-report.json
*.patch
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
e2e-*.mjs
verify-*.mjs
capture-*.mjs
debug-*.mjs
sc-capture*.js
sc-capture*.cjs
test-smokecraft-*.mjs
final-acceptance.mjs
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
# R2 sync deployment fix — scripts/smokecraftAssetsSyncR2.mjs needs the
# real approved SmokeCraft source images present in the build context to
# recompute checksums and upload them (its whole job). The blanket
# *.png/*.jpg/*.jpeg exclusion above blocked every one of them from ever
# reaching any Docker build stage, not just the runtime image — a real,
# separate defect from the missing `COPY scripts` in the Dockerfile.
# Re-include only the approved SmokeCraft asset trees (a directory-level
# rule earlier in this file, `public/proof`, still excludes every
# browser-proof/QA screenshot regardless of these negations — negation
# patterns cannot resurrect files under an already-excluded directory).
!public/assets/smokecraft/**/*.png
!public/assets/smokecraft/**/*.jpg
!public/assets/smokecraft/**/*.jpeg
!public/assets/smokecraft-reference/**/*.png
!public/assets/smokecraft-reference/**/*.jpg
!public/assets/smokecraft-reference/**/*.jpeg
!public/smokecraft-visit-complete.png
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
server/_local_media_storage
